title Cassette LOAD in real time: the strip keeps TAKE 006 until the cassette has landed (about 600 ms), keys are ignored while it goes in, then TAKE 007 is loaded, ready at 00:00, and PLAY plays it
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 500
key l
wait 400
key up
wait 200
key l
wait 150
@480x320 expect text "TAKE 006 · 48k/16 WAV · 12 h 40 left"
key space
key x
wait 100
say Space and X were ignored during the animation
wait 1300
@480x320 expect text "TAKE 007 · 48k/16 WAV · 12 h 40 left"
expect text "Take 007"
shot load-done
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
key space
wait 300
@480x320 expect text "PLAYING TAKE 007 · 00:00 / 00:42"
@320x480 expect text "00:00 / 00:42"
say PLAY plays the loaded take from 00:00
expect noquit
